# Optional configuration for source builds. Every value here is public — release
# builds inject their own at build time. Do not put server-side secrets in this
# file; it is committed.
#
# laplus runs entirely locally. Nothing below is needed to build the
# application, run the server, or open the window.

# The port `laplus-server` listens on. Defaults to 4773; `apps/web`'s dev server
# proxies to it, so change both or neither.
# LAPLUS_PORT=4773
